<title>HONG KONG: Amoy Properties interim net up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Amoy Properties interim net up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   37.7  vs  33.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    16.0  vs  15.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	   nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			   959.7  vs  836.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,450.20  vs  1,219.90</p>
<p>    Company name		 Amoy Properties Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 14-16</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Amoy Properties, a 50.9 percent owned subsidiary of Hang Lung Development Co Ltd, engages in property investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
